fixture strike_stick_up_diagonal
doc a strike with the stick just past the up diagonal (x=80 y=-81) and with a d-pad's up-right (both axes full): the vertical axis is at least as long, so both are the up-strike (4 equal sectors, the diagonal itself going vertical).
room test/flat
spawn 200 544
frames 40
input
  0..9 R
  10 x=80 y=-81 attack
  11..19 x=80 y=-81
  20..29 -
  30 x=127 y=-127 attack
  31..39 x=127 y=-127
end
expect
  at 10 action=up
  at 30 action=up
end
